  "deferredChanges": [
    {
      "questID": 79242,
      "reason": "The captured page supplies Tokal as starter, Illari Duskfeather as the NPC target, an Illari\u2019s Loot Cache turn-in and an additional Illari\u2019s Key requirement, but no verified source location for the key. Marking this objective incomplete causes the current fixed guide compiler to omit all three guide stages. The shipped record is retained pending main-developer coordination."
    }
  ],
  "knownUnknowns": [
    "Magram/Gelkis reputation availability on Forever beta NPC offers is not confirmed from quest ordering alone. Preserve existing unverified pickup flags for quests 1369, 1370, 1371, 1373, 1374, 1375, 1380, 1381, 1384 and 1386.",
    "Quest 1371 Advanced Target Dummy source remains unmapped; no relation between an item and named vendors/mobs was inferred.",
    "Quest 5561 Kodo Roundup has an unmapped Aged Kodo alternative and an unknown number of lasso interactions.",
    "Quest 6568 Testament of Rexxar has no verified local objective/action location.",
    "Quest 79236 requires Cherry Grog, but its supported item acquisition location remains unknown.",
